check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:08.7846415Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:08.7847484Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
